      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어제 우리 작전을 밀렵꾼들에게 팔아넘기고도,\n용케 그런 태도를 보이시네요…….\n그 치즈는 뭐예요?　또 훔친 건가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "598889d8f84cdd326f64c20a91bf1f87fc1bca0e2b8c83c2e502ec9169c7b83f:000001_-837631482325180700:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "昨日、僕たちの作戦を密猟者に横流ししておいて、\nよくそんな態度が取れますね……。\nそのチーズなんですか？　また盗んだんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
